  "estimated_difficulty": "medium",
  "backtest_data_needs": "EURUSD M15+H1+H4 730 days",
  "python_conversion_notes": "Requires 3 data streams at different timeframes (M15, H1, H4). Compute 5 SMAs per TF, compare current vs previous bar SMA values for direction scoring. Replicate AC (Accelerator Oscillator) using AO - SMA(AO,5) where AO = SMA(median,5) - SMA(median,34). AC scoring logic has 3-state classification (bullish=3, bearish=3, neutral=0) based on 4-bar histogram pattern. Composite score per TF = (sum of 5 MA direction bits + AC score) * 12.5. Entry when all 3 TF scores exceed threshold. Trailing stop moves SL to breakeven+trail once price moves in favor by Trailing points. Deviation uses 3*spread for slippage tolerance.",
